he normalized task description in Ui.java and match\nresults into named local variables in Ui.showMatchingTasks.\n\nThe previous expression performed normalization and substring\nmatching inline, causing multiple operations to be parsed\nat once. Naming the intermediate values makes the logic easier\nto understand without changing the behaviour.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":3,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"6dd00db6d821d1a0a52e7d0b5c4e3fe6794f8f5c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Centralize CLI task-saving logic","messageBody":"Move repeated try/catch blocks into an individual method.\n\nThe repeated nested try/catch blocks made the command-processing\nflow hard to read. Centralizing this responsibility reduces nesting\nwhile preserving its behaviour.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":14,"deletions":25}}},{"hash":"d169dfc8981db824dd1e5c4f2d75500dfcab08b6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Make task fields immutable","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":5,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"0717c3483ed2d259987511768e556ccd97caa662","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Centralize task number validation","messageBody":"Task-number parsing and range validation commands are repeated\nacross multiple methods. Centralizing this logic will ensure\nthat the CLI and GUI use the same validation behaviour.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":8,"deletions":34}}},{"hash":"5df654bc5762a80dd581c34309917e75c2b027c9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Replace hard-coded command substring offsets","messageBody":"Use named command prefixes and shared argument extraction to\nmake parsing rules explicit and reduce off-by-one risks.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":27,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"0eb3b726eb56809a2797e94dc97ee65705ba84b9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use Streams feature of Java","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"ja